# PLAN-2 reproducible local retrieval bundle. Keep the runtime databases,
# environment files, logs, caches, and historical non-active candidates local.
# The unignored candidate is the active hybrid corpus referenced by active.json;
# all other `.local` files remain ignored.
!apps/scut-senior/.local/
apps/scut-senior/.local/*
!apps/scut-senior/.local/models/
apps/scut-senior/.local/models/*
